        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Read the labour term, the in-home clause and the exclusions
            first.</strong> The lifetime frame figure is the least important number on the page.
            Register the machine, keep proof of purchase, and follow the manual on lubricant,
            environment and use.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Extended cover is rarely worth it on budget machines</strong> and
